From: Jules <jules@workstation>
Date: Sun, 7 Dec 2025 03:01:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add 'top' subcommand to /tps and adjust permissions

This patch introduces a 'top' subcommand to the /tps command to display
the most loaded regions and refines the permission system.

- New `/tps top` command: Shows the top 5 regions with the lowest TPS,
  helping admins quickly identify performance hotspots.
- Unified admin permission: `/tps all` and `/tps top` now require the
  `minecraft.command.tps.admin` permission.
- Default region permission: `/tps` and `/tps region` are intended for
  general use and require `minecraft.command.tps.region`.

--- a/src/main/java/io/papermc/paper/threadedregions/commands/CommandServerHealth.java
+++ b/src/main/java/io/papermc/paper/threadedregions/commands/CommandServerHealth.java
